Context Compression Gateway for AI Agents

Then, somewhere deep into the workflow, it starts to drift.

It re-reads files it has already summarized, forgets constraints that were provided at the beginning, invokes the same tool multiple times with slightly different arguments and eventually produces an answer that sounds confident but may not actually be correct.

The natural explanation is that the context window filled up. In many cases, the context window still had plenty of room left.

As the context grew longer, the model got worse at using the information already inside it.

